l8p_cprot: record l8p round 11, Layer 4 register row (c): L8P-R10-F1 as a design choice, L4A-67 (C-PROT rev 1 for the guard on the
corrected circuit) and L4A-68 (the guard's allowance for its consumers) (MESHSAT-1357, 7 October 2026). Desk arithmetic on the makers'
printed figures and the records' own; nothing was built, bought or measured. LABELS: PRINTED; TYPICAL (never a limit); READING;
INFERRED; MODEL; RECORD; ASSUMED.

